    model          : d_model=1536 d_ff=4608 heads=24 layers=4+36(x1)+4 vocab=23 (eos=20 pad=21 mask=22)
    params         : ~1350M in 44 distinct layers, 44 applied/token (head_dim=64, checkpoint_chunk=6)
    batch          : canvas=512 micro=8/rank x accum 4 (rows split round-robin across 4 betas)
    corpora        : 50% paired AFDB + 50% aa-only UniRef (rows without a structure label get an all-MASK structure track and are excluded from the structure loss)
    tracks         : 2 (amino acid + Foldseek 3Di at the same L positions; separate embeddings and heads, INDEPENDENT noise level per track) | 3Di kernel=mat3di struct_weight=1.0 struct_first=0.0
    shards         : /flare/NLDesignProtein/bryan/Diffusion-dev-space/datasets/afdb_3di_shards  exists: True
    corruption     : span_width=(1, 8, 32, 128)  (mask drawn as a correlated field; amount and per-position marginals unchanged, L_vb is a mean-field surrogate not an ELBO)
    objective      : betas=(1.0, 0.9, 0.75, 0.5) T=500 kernel=blosum | L = 1.0*T*E[KL] + 1.0*L_ce(corrupted, uncorr_w=0.0) | eos_w=20.0 pad_w=0.1
    sampling       : T=1.0 steps=512 eos_first=True subst/residue=1.0 (unified edit decode)
    schedule       : 18000 steps, warmup 2000, lr 0.0002, eval every 500, ckpt every 1000
    TRAIN_NODES              = 15
    TRAIN_RANKS              = 180
    FOLD_RANKS_PER_NODE      = 12
